{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:LiftingAndDescent.GlobalGluing","@type":"LeanModule","name":"LiftingAndDescent.GlobalGluing","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.Group.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.Ring.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.Ring.Hom.Defs","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.Module.Basic"],"declarations":20,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.global_algebra_is_ring","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.global_algebra_is_ring","kind":"def","line":92,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lifting-and-descent/global-gluing.lean#L92-L97","doc":"The global algebra inherits a ring structure from the local data.\n(`Ring _` is data, not a `Prop`, so this is a `def`.) ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.GlobalGluing.instVac","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.GlobalGluing.instVac","kind":"theorem","line":88,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lifting-and-descent/global-gluing.lean#L88-L88","doc":"The vacuum state exists on the global algebra. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.GlobalGluing.VacuumWellDefined","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.GlobalGluing.VacuumWellDefined","kind":"def","line":86,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lifting-and-descent/global-gluing.lean#L86-L86","doc":"The vacuum state τ : A_∞ → R is well-defined globally. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.GlobalGluing.unique_patches","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.GlobalGluing.unique_patches","kind":"theorem","line":84,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lifting-and-descent/global-gluing.lean#L84-L84","doc":"Uniqueness: the global algebra is determined by the local data.\nAny two global algebras satisfying the gluing condition are\nisomorphic as R-algebras. Full proof uses Yekutieli's theorem. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.GlobalGluing.tqm","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.GlobalGluing.tqm","kind":"def","line":79,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lifting-and-descent/global-gluing.lean#L79-L79","doc":"The twisted quantization data. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.GlobalGluing.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.GlobalGluing.mk","kind":"ctor","line":77,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lifting-and-descent/global-gluing.lean#L77-L77","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.GlobalGluing","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.GlobalGluing","kind":"structure","line":70,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lifting-and-descent/global-gluing.lean#L70-L88","doc":"**Global gluing theorem**: the Yekutieli twisted quantization\nmap produces a well-defined global algebra, and the vacuum state\nτ is globally consistent.\n\nThis formalises: A_∞ is a well-defined global section of a sheaf\nof twisted deformation algebras on 𝒮. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.TwistedQuantizationMap.compatible","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.TwistedQuantizationMap.compatible","kind":"theorem","line":65,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lifting-and-descent/global-gluing.lean#L65-L65","doc":"The embeddings are compatible on overlaps:\nthe composite map local_i → global → local_j agrees with the\nČech transition isomorphism on overlaps U_i ∩ U_j.\nThis is the sheaf gluing condition for the twisted quantization. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.TwistedQuantizationMap.localToGlobal","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.TwistedQuantizationMap.localToGlobal","kind":"def","line":59,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lifting-and-descent/global-gluing.lean#L59-L59","doc":"Embedding of each local algebra into the global algebra. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.TwistedQuantizationMap.instGlobalRing","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.TwistedQuantizationMap.instGlobalRing","kind":"def","line":57,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lifting-and-descent/global-gluing.lean#L57-L57","doc":"The global algebra is a ring. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.TwistedQuantizationMap.GlobalAlgebra","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.TwistedQuantizationMap.GlobalAlgebra","kind":"def","line":55,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lifting-and-descent/global-gluing.lean#L55-L55","doc":"The global algebra (direct limit A_∞). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.TwistedQuantizationMap.localData","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.TwistedQuantizationMap.localData","kind":"def","line":53,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lifting-and-descent/global-gluing.lean#L53-L53","doc":"The local deformation data. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.TwistedQuantizationMap.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.TwistedQuantizationMap.mk","kind":"ctor","line":51,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lifting-and-descent/global-gluing.lean#L51-L51","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.TwistedQuantizationMap","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.TwistedQuantizationMap","kind":"structure","line":44,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lifting-and-descent/global-gluing.lean#L44-L66","doc":"**Twisted quantization map**: Yekutieli's construction that\nproduces a global algebra from compatible local deformations.\n\nThe key property is that the twisted associative structure on\neach patch is compatible with the Čech transitions, so the\nlocal algebras glue into a single sheaf of algebras. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.LocalDeformation.instModule","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.LocalDeformation.instModule","kind":"def","line":40,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lifting-and-descent/global-gluing.lean#L40-L40","doc":"Each local algebra is an `R`-module. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.LocalDeformation.instRing","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.LocalDeformation.instRing","kind":"def","line":38,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lifting-and-descent/global-gluing.lean#L38-L38","doc":"Each local algebra is an `R`-algebra. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.LocalDeformation.localAlgebra","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.LocalDeformation.localAlgebra","kind":"def","line":36,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lifting-and-descent/global-gluing.lean#L36-L36","doc":"The local algebra at each patch. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.LocalDeformation.numPatches","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.LocalDeformation.numPatches","kind":"def","line":34,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lifting-and-descent/global-gluing.lean#L34-L34","doc":"Index set for the covering patches. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.LocalDeformation.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.LocalDeformation.mk","kind":"ctor","line":32,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lifting-and-descent/global-gluing.lean#L32-L32","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.LocalDeformation","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.LocalDeformation","kind":"structure","line":28,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lifting-and-descent/global-gluing.lean#L28-L40","doc":"**Local deformation algebra**: at each point p, the algebra\n`𝒪_{q(p)}(G)` of functions on the quantum group deformed by\nthe local substrate parameter `q(p)`. ","signatureChunk":0}]}